notes.body:
One idea for your next iteration is to have a 3-pane layout configuration for the welcome page, just like we have for a capture file. Then I would get my wish of having the "Open" and the "Capture" lists side-by side, and optionally the new Tips and Learn sections in the bottom.

Quick sketch to explain:
